/ROUTINE TO CALCULATE PMOLE VALUES OF UNKNOWNS USING LINE EQUATION OF
/STANDARD CURVE
/BB = SLOPE
/AA = Y INTERCEPT
	 
DOUNK,	SET 17
	0
	LDF 7
	SET I 1
	2400		/PROBIT VALUE OF UNKNOWNS PTR
	SET 4
	UCNTR		/NO. OF UNKNOWNS CNTR
	 
